I merged `integrate/wave2` (`59e5a7b`, release #67) into this branch with a merge commit, at `6801f2d`. #67 already contains the crosswalks, signals, street signs and trees, so this PR's diff against the base is now only the land cover:
- `pipeline/lib/landcover.ts` and `pipeline/lib/osm-pbf.ts`;
- `src/render/street-landcover.ts`;
- `street-landcover.json` (DataSF, PDDL) and `street-osm.json` (OpenStreetMap, ODbL);
- their schemas, tests and screenshots;
- small hook-ups in `street-detail.ts`, `debug.ts` and `scene.ts` (pier height above the water).

Local evidence (Actions is blocked by billing):
- `pnpm typecheck`: clean.
- vitest: 193 files, 3,597 passed, 1 skipped.
- `build-street-detail --offline --check` with the pinned OSM extract: OK.

This PR stays a draft until the owner signs off on ODbL and adds the "© OpenStreetMap contributors" credit in the UI.

